Dear Daniel,

Following the issuance of NR-AB-2023-04 regarding the wall thickness nonconformity on line NR-21-L-0207 in ANLAGE-21, we require a Fitness-for-Service assessment from corporate integrity. The latest grid measurement on the elbow at NR-21-L-0207-05, detailed in RLW-PB-2023-0201, shows a minimum thickness of 1.7 mm over an area of approximately 40 x 60 mm. This value is below the 2.0 mm minimum required by our Werksnorm for this P235GH condensate line.

The measurement history indicates a steady decline from 4.00 mm in 2003 to the current 1.85 mm reading, with the remaining life now expired. Please review the data to determine if continued operation is permissible until the next scheduled outage or if immediate repairs are necessary.

Best regards,  Sabine Overbeck

